.idea/

# --- Project data never travels with the harness ---
# Everything under active-project/ is the current run's working state: intake material,
# the spec, the backlog, WP specs and prompts, Codex replies, acceptance checks, the
# morning report. It is wiped or replaced between projects and must never be committed.
# Only the scaffolding that tells the user what goes where is tracked.
# Cross-project memory lives in LESSONS.md at the repo root, which IS tracked.
active-project/*
!active-project/intake/
active-project/intake/*
!active-project/intake/README.md
!active-project/checks/
active-project/checks/*
!active-project/checks/README.md
!active-project/wps/
active-project/wps/*
!active-project/wps/.keep

# --- Closed-out projects, kept for reference only ---
# Same rule: never committed. /archive-project moves a finished run here;
# /reactivate-project moves one back into active-project/.
projects-archive/*
!projects-archive/README.md
